@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-pawn-gas-collision.puml
' purpose: ally-tank-vs-mecha gas fixture is not the live collision beat
' status: OUTDATED — withdrawn as specified; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
'         packages/starchess-core/src/rules/specials/pawnDouble.ts
' live spec: _spec/packages/starchess-core/mine-contact.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Live collision lesson is king-defense-4: mecha vs enemy tank, same-square
' move-phase trade — not friendly-fire gas. Marine gas is specials/marine.
' Teaching the backlog pair against yesterday's rule would fight the engine.
title OUTDATED — do not shoot ally-tank gas\nas a new siege-runner fixture

component "specials/marine\nlive pawnDouble" as GAS <<app>>
component "king-defense-4\nmecha × enemy tank" as HIT <<app>>
component "**ally tank vs mecha gas**\nnot a live beat" as PAIR <<error>>

GAS ARROW_OPTIONAL HIT : different lessons
PAIR ARROW_ERROR GAS : do not add as written

note bottom of PAIR
  **A new gas-collision beat must name
  the live occupants and the live
  rule after measuring resolve, not
  the backlog pair.**
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Diff ""tutorialScript.config.ts"".
  Pin collision in core before any
  new caption.
end legend
@enduml
